{"3892430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ADORATE", "steam_appid": 3892430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>ADORATE</strong></i><strong> is a casual town-builder RTS where you take the role of an evil god amassing a cult of followers!</strong><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892430/extras/f2c21182920e6ac76397909428b0b192.poster.avif?t=1756728634\" width=780 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892430/extras/f2c21182920e6ac76397909428b0b192.webm?t=1756728634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892430/extras/f2c21182920e6ac76397909428b0b192.mp4?t=1756728634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>SUMMON YOUR IDOL</strong>  <br>An evil god like yourself is befitting of a proper monument. Summon your idol and defend it!<br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892430/extras/b883b355c3aeae870f0348b7b967a93b.poster.avif?t=1756728634\" width=780 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892430/extras/b883b355c3aeae870f0348b7b967a93b.webm?t=1756728634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892430/extras/b883b355c3aeae870f0348b7b967a93b.mp4?t=1756728634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>ESTABLISH A HOME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your culties will need shelter and a place to worship you. Summon and customise buildings and defenses to create a home worthy of your cult.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892430/extras/a55ffdc63a789f9ca8dff4370b7f36a9.poster.avif?t=1756728634\" width=780 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892430/extras/a55ffdc63a789f9ca8dff4370b7f36a9.webm?t=1756728634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892430/extras/a55ffdc63a789f9ca8dff4370b7f36a9.mp4?t=1756728634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>THEIR LIVES, YOUR PAWNS</strong> <br>Drain your culties' life force to cast spells in order to defend your cult from incoming holies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892430/extras/90ab8892a0ee46c4c68ad647d8c36afe.poster.avif?t=1756728634\" width=780 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892430/extras/90ab8892a0ee46c4c68ad647d8c36afe.webm?t=1756728634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892430/extras/90ab8892a0ee46c4c68ad647d8c36afe.mp4?t=1756728634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNLOCK NEW POWERS</strong>  <br>Specialize your culties to cast new spells.<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892430/extras/6685907ab8dba6b510183d26a4a7afd5.poster.avif?t=1756728634\" width=780 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892430/extras/6685907ab8dba6b510183d26a4a7afd5.webm?t=1756728634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892430/extras/6685907ab8dba6b510183d26a4a7afd5.mp4?t=1756728634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>FEND OFF THE HOLIES</strong>  <br>Holies will come to try and stop your heresy. Do not allow them to rapture your culties away!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gridless casual town building with fast-paced action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressive 2D characters in a stylized 3D world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of enemy holie types which will invade your cult.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultie specializations which unlock new spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly placed decoration to give your cult personality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original dynamic soundtrack<br><br><br><strong>NOTE: ADORATE is in very early development! Keep an eye on our socials to keep up with the cult!</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>ADORATE</strong></i><strong> is a casual town-builder RTS where you take the role of an evil god amassing a cult of followers!</strong><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892430/extras/f2c21182920e6ac76397909428b0b192.poster.avif?t=1756728634\" width=780 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892430/extras/f2c21182920e6ac76397909428b0b192.webm?t=1756728634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892430/extras/f2c21182920e6ac76397909428b0b192.mp4?t=1756728634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>SUMMON YOUR IDOL</strong>  <br>An evil god like yourself is befitting of a proper monument. Summon your idol and defend it!<br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https: